{"synopsis":"Kiamat melanda, dan semua tanaman serta sumber air habis.\n\nDunia sedang panik, dan makanan serta kelangsungan hidup sekali lagi menjadi topik perhatian terbesar orang-orang.\n\nBeras dan mie telah menjadi barang mewah, dan sayuran bahkan lebih mahal!\n\nNamun, saat ini, seseorang mengirim video ke situs tersebut, yang mengejutkan dunia.\n\nSayuran manis digulung ke dalam hot pot, memancarkan warna hijau yang menarik!\n\nKaki domba emas panggang mendesis dan berminyak!\n\nSup ikan yang lezat semurni dan seputih susu!\n\nGadis kecil di samping phon: Kakak, aku benar-benar tidak bisa makan lagi!","alternative_title":"Eden's Last Stand, Doomsday Super Farm, 이클립스: 시스템 농사꾼","author":"诶嘿工作室","artist":"诶嘿工作室","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"bbebc345-8818-4d05-a780-783386900403","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"","date":"2025-03-21","released":"2025-03-21"},{"chapter_id":"ede0cc64-49c3-42d5-a69a-e20307d82be2","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"","date":"2025-03-20","released":"2025-03-20"},{"chapter_id":"d5abf9f5-5e20-47fc-99bf-ca51967dea28","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"4969f206-7784-4dc5-b59f-2c3689c67cfb","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"e0e17b7e-7ba6-40d9-8de0-df054a64cca1","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"ee0777c7-05cc-4a3c-ae81-c9f72f6f8dc8","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"598a5470-a920-4402-819c-416ece51807a","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"fdbeb937-1e28-4472-aa2e-c21fd895634f","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"014743e5-2e90-407b-8727-823cf019051c","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"39901